The following Employment Cost Index files are on the BLS internet in the subdirectory 
pub/time.series/ec:

       contact.doc	- Contacts for BLS surveys
       ec.compensation	- Comp_code mapping file
       ec.data.0.Current- Employment Cost Index data for current year
       ec.data.1.AllData- All Employment Cost Index data 
       ec.doc		- General information
       ec.group		- Group_code       mapping file
       ec.ownership	- Ownership_code   mapping file
       ec.period	- Period_code      mapping file
       ec.periodicity	- Periodicity_code mapping file
       ec.series	- All series and their beginning dates



Both of the above data files (ec.data.0.Current  &  ec.data.1.AllData) have the following 
format:

       series_id              period                 
           |                    |                   
       ---------               ---                  
       ECU12803Q       1993    Q01            0.3   
                       ----                   ---   
                         |                     |    
                        year                 value  
                            



 The  series_id  can be broken down into:


     Series               ownership_code    
       |     comp_code       |                                  
       |         |           |               
      --         -           -               
      EC    U    1    280    3   Q           
            -          -         -           
            |          |         |           
            |       group_code   |          
         seasonal            periodicity_code




   CODE DEFINITIONS

              
 Series:             EC - Employment Cost Index
  
 seasonal:           U  - unadjusted data
                     S  - seasonally adjusted data


 comp_code:           1 - Total Compensation
                      2 - Wages and salaries
                      3 - Benefits 

       
 group_code:          Industry, occupation classification codes
                      see  pub/time.series/ec/ec.group  for a detailed
                      explanation of all group codes.


 ownership_code:      1 - Civilian
                      2 - Private
                      3 - State and Local government


 periodicity_code:    I - Index
                      Q - 3 month percent change
                      A - 12 month percent change


 period:            Q01 - 1st Quarter
                    Q02 - 2nd Quarter
                    Q03 - 3rd Quarter
                    Q04 - 4th Quarter
                    Q05 - Annual Average (NOT USED)
